      "text": "Convergence of go‑mHC is governed by the geometry of the loss landscape introduced by manifold M and gradient stability; go‑mHC is expected to have learnable gradients, be convergent, and fully connected (able to reach any target matrix). See Appendix B.7 for proofs.",
